  "description": "Spaceborne magnetometers for measuring magnetic fields: fluxgate (DC-10 Hz, 1 pT precision), search-coil (AC variations), and scalar helium/optically-pumped magnetometers (absolute accuracy). Used on every planetary mission for mapping intrinsic and induced magnetospheres.",
